    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Positive</td><td>Energy much better</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Negative</td><td>No breathlessness on one flight of stairs</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Negative</td><td>No pain after the procedures</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Positive</td><td>Less tingling; numbness at the ends of the feet; no falls</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>4 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

